    <body>
      <div type="work" n="175">
        <pb n="222"/>
        <head>Another.</head>
        <head>175 — xi — IV. — <quote>We may hear what the Lord our God speaketh</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">Lord, thou thyself saidst to the<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> holy apostles, <quote>Verily, verily, I say <pb n="223"/> unto you, if a grain of wheat fall<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> not upon the earth and be buried and die, the grain abideth alone; but, if it<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> be buried and die, it beareth much fruit<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/></quote>. And of such<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> words we have seen a<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/> true and clear and very close picture in the death of the illustrious martyrs; for it bears fruit in miracles and healings, and drives far away all the deception of the devil, and brings in the God-befitting wealth of thy goodness: which through<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a8" target="#n8" n="8"/> their prayers bestow upon us in thy mercy, merciful Lord.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 222, n. 6</orig></choice> Ps. lxxxv, 9.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 222, n. 7</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>thy</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 223, n. 1</orig></choice> John xii, 24, 25.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 223, n. 2</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>it (do so)</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 223, n. 3</orig></choice> Unintelligible corr.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 223, n. 4</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>these</quote>.</note>
